//
// The shape a transformer layer's norm1/norm2 run at: T = 32 tokens, d_model = 128.
//
// ROWS must be a multiple of the SIMD lane count (SIMD_FP16_LANES): the transposed path puts
// one token per FP16 lane, so the tile is ROWS / lanes lane groups of one beat each. D must
// be a power of two: both the core's mean and the hardware rsqrt's a = 1/D are
// exponent-only, exact at 2^k and not otherwise.
{
    ROWS: 32, // tokens; one per FP16 lane in the transposed path, a multiple of the lanes
    D: 128,   // d_model (FP16 elements), a power of two, a multiple of the lanes
}
